@PoolSense.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5217

GET {{PoolSense.Api_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### GitHub connection status (sign in to PoolSense first)
GET {{PoolSense.Api_HostAddress}}/api/github/connection

### Start GitHub OAuth; open the returned URL in the same authenticated browser
POST {{PoolSense.Api_HostAddress}}/api/github/connect
X-PoolSense-CSRF: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### List accessible repository registrations
@projectId = YOUR_PROJECT_ID
@repositoryId = REPOSITORY_ID_FROM_CREATE
GET {{PoolSense.Api_HostAddress}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/repositories

### Add repository and queue initial indexing
POST {{PoolSense.Api_HostAddress}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/repositories
X-PoolSense-CSRF: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{"url":"https://github.com/dotnet/runtime","branch":"main","enabled":true}

### Get one registration
GET {{PoolSense.Api_HostAddress}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/repositories/{{repositoryId}}

### Update branch/settings; authorize indexing as the current user
PUT {{PoolSense.Api_HostAddress}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/repositories/{{repositoryId}}
X-PoolSense-CSRF: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{"url":"https://github.com/dotnet/runtime","branch":"main","enabled":true}

### Check current branch SHA; rebuild only if changed
POST {{PoolSense.Api_HostAddress}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/repositories/{{repositoryId}}/refresh
X-PoolSense-CSRF: 1

### Take indexing ownership using your connected GitHub account
POST {{PoolSense.Api_HostAddress}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/repositories/{{repositoryId}}/take-ownership
X-PoolSense-CSRF: 1

### Remove a repository
DELETE {{PoolSense.Api_HostAddress}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/repositories/{{repositoryId}}
X-PoolSense-CSRF: 1

### Disconnect GitHub for the current user
DELETE {{PoolSense.Api_HostAddress}}/api/github/connection
X-PoolSense-CSRF: 1
